    "creativeDirection": "Direction: an honest synthetic test fixture for six composited recipes. Frame an interface detail, reveal a product shape, mark a celebration, lock focus, pass a soft light or reveal a fine frame. Keep labels readable and the focal element visible. Use at most two brief layers per scene and a clear hold after each effect. Avoid treating these shapes as a real app demonstration. Review entrance, strongest frame, completion, target visibility and both bright and dark backgrounds."
